{
  "_notes": [
    "Shared unit vocabulary referenced by all templates.",
    "'colloquial' lists local naming variants worth accepting as synonyms",
    "in product entry (e.g. so 'goro' resolves to the gorogoro unit).",
    "This list is a draft — colloquial terms especially need native review.",
    "'debe_20l' removed intentionally (C10 build) — a debe isn't a",
    "standard size the way gorogoro is; it varies by container. Litre/ml",
    "cover that case correctly instead via ProductUnit.ratio_to_parent."
